00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:22.420
The Russian word robot and the English word robot are actually the exact same word.

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:23.600
Оля.

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:30.820
They both come from the Czech word robota, which means forced labor or hard work.

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:32.200
Оля.

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:39.780
It started in all Slavic languages, went into Czech and was made famous in 1920 by a Czech writer

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:41.560
