00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:42.780
Оля.

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:46.960
The play was translated into Russian and English very quickly.

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:48.060
Оля.

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:51.800
The word robot spread around the world like wildfire.

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:52.980
Оля.

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:55.340
